; FARO exterior: the island of Albor, 12x8 sectors (GDD 6.1). M1b uses 6 of them:
; (2,4) Claro tras las zarzas  (2,5)-(3,5) Varadero  (2,6) muelle  (3,6) Sendero del Cabo
; (3,7) Cabo y Faro. Fill: forest (2,3) (3,3) (3,4), bruma (4,4) (4,5), sea elsewhere (deduped).
; Object coordinates are absolute cells (Varadero origin = 32,80).
@ map ISLA
@ metatiles metatiles
@ size 12 8
@ border SEA
